{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3078", "id": 3561717265, "node_id": "I_kwDOLW-eZs7US34R", "number": 3078, "title": "[form controls] Make control state available outside `Field.Root`", "user": {"login": "kenanyusuf", "id": 9557798, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjk1NTc3OTg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9557798?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf", "html_url": "https://github.com/kenanyusuf", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kenanyusuf/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 6619599312, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABio8R0A", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/type:%20enhancement", "name": "type: enhancement", "color": "c7def8", "default": false, "description": "It\u2019s an improvement, but we can\u2019t make up our mind whether it's a bug fix or a new feature.", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6621343520, "node_id": "LA_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABiqmvIA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/labels/waiting%20for%20%F0%9F%91%8D", "name": "waiting for \ud83d\udc4d", "color": "fff5d6", "default": false, "description": "Waiting for upvotes. Open for community feedback and needs more interest to be worked on.", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "state": "open", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:59:15Z", "updated_at": "2026-02-11T05:21:31Z", "closed_at": null, "assignee": null, "author_association": "MEMBER", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "# Feature request\n\n## Summary\n\nI would like to access the `state` object from the render prop of components like Input and Select without needing to wrap the control in Field.Root.\n\nCurrently, state is available in the render function:\n```tsx\n<Input\n  render={(props, state) => {\n    <>\n      <SearchIcon fill={state.focused || state.filled ? 'gray' : 'black'} />\n      <input {...props} />\n      {state.filled && <ClearButton />}\n    </>\n  )}\n/>\n```\n\n\u2026but the values of state (dirty, touched, filled, focused) do not update unless the control is wrapped in `Field.Root`, as mentioned in the docs for the relevant data attributes. Since these properties describe the control itself, not just the field, it would be convenient if the state were accurate at the control level.\n\n## Motivation\n\nI want to implement UI behaviour based on the control's state without introducing a Field.Root wrapper for every individual control.\n\nExample: https://codesandbox.io/p/sandbox/control-state-llh87m\n", "closed_by": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null, "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3459624802", "html_url": "https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/3078#issuecomment-3459624802", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3078", "id": 3459624802, "node_id": "IC_kwDOLW-eZs7ONa9i", "user": {"login": "mj12albert", "id": 4997971, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert", "html_url": "https://github.com/mj12albert", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-10-29T04:52:54Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-29T04:52:54Z", "body": "This would apply to:\n- autocomplete\n- checkbox(group)\n- combobox\n- input\n- number field\n- radio(group)\n- select\n- slider\n- switch\n\nIt should be done so that the states are propagated to Field components if used, there are valid use cases for styling them based on the data attrs and also avoids a breaking change", "author_association": "MEMBER", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3459624802/reactions", "total_count": 1, "+1": 1, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]}